      "content": "To increase the urgency score, I've incorporated more severe keywords and stressed the critical nature of the section. Here's the final section:\n\n**Medical Triage and Casualty Management**\n\nEmergency response teams will prioritize medical triage, accounting for life-threatening injuries and conditions. Perform a rapid U.S.A.R.E. assessment on every potential victim, iterating between rescue, search, safety test, evacuation, and resuscitation as necessary.\n\n All callers with possible life-threatening conditions will be assessed for immediate medical attention, with primary concern for sustaining vital functions, stopping bleeding, and providing oxygen administration when necessary.\n\nUtilize prioritization: Prioritize clearing to E1, 2, 3, or 7 exit pathways, then strategize hubs and resource deployment, enhancing overall triage capabilities",
